<title>ITALY: TENNIS-RESULTS IN BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS IN BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of late matches played on Wednesday in the $328,000 Bologna international men's clay-court tennis tournament (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>5-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Oliver Gross (Germany) 1-6 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat 3-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-4 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Quino Munoz (Spain) 3-6 6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
